  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Thinly slice carrot into half-moons.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06faf5ad8e6534c44384/step-d33aad00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook veggie mince and lemon pepper seasoning, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes (it will finish cooking in step 3!). Transfer to a bowl.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook carrot, stirring occasionally, until softened, 3-4 minutes. Add garlic paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. TIP: The seasoning will char in the pan, this adds to the flavour!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06faf5ad8e6534c44384/step-04e83910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return veggie mince to pan, then add red pesto, stirring to coat. Add the water, couscous and vegetable stock. Stir to combine.\n• Bring to the boil, cover with a lid, then remove from heat. Set aside until liquid is absorbed and veggie mince is cooked through, 5 minutes.\n• When the couscous is ready, fluff up with a fork. Stir through baby spinach leaves until wilted. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06faf5ad8e6534c44384/step-63c95020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop parsley leaves.\n• Divide pesto plant-based mince and couscous between bowls.\n• Drizzle with creamy pesto dressing. Garnish with parsley to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681b06faf5ad8e6534c44384/step-9ac2ae30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
